// IntroString :
"P2865108894" "According to these files you recovered, my agent had found four probable candidates whose knowledge and talents are needed for Operation: DESTINY to succeed. Of course, in order to properly persuade them, I need these gentlemen to be in Arachnos custody. You can take care of that, can't you, {VillainName}? The first candidate is a Dr. Franks. He is a SERAPH researcher, currently working with their temporal mechanics division. And while the Paragon Police will likely have him under heavy guard, that should present no obstacle for you to <A HREF={ACCEPT}> go in and retrieve him from Paragon City.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2149139737" "Kidnap Dr. Franks"
// SendOffString :
"P4160933212" "I would exercise caution in this task if I were you. Breaking into a SERAPH lab is not exactly the world's easiest assignment."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P403814596" "I want Dr. Franks in my custody. Immediately!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3013003941" "You take a moment to reflect how it's always the little people, like Dr. Franks, who are hurt by Arachnos' big schemes. Saps."

